Description: Competence-based knowledge space theory (CbKST) is
  an extension of knowledge space theory (KST) modeling the latent 
  skills and competencies underlying the observable response 
  behaviour as described by Heller & Stefanutti (2024) 
  <doi:10.1142/9789811280481_0001>. The package focuses on the mappings
  between competence and performance level (skill (multi) map, 
  problem function etc.).
